    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=0AwRbQI9oZra0EYR]], each creature in a 30-foot Cone. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage 5d6 average type=necrotic]] damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage. <em>Failure or Success:</em> A Humanoid reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage dies, and a Shadow rises from its corpse. The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} is under the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s control and shares the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s Initiative count but acts immediately after the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}.</p>",
